<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46527" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωπῠρ-έω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζώπυρον</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>kindle into flame, cause to
				blaze up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. τοὺς ἄνθρακας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					71
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πνεῦμα ζ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Ign.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			:—in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be quickened by fire</i>, of the foetus, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				1.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέριμναι ζωπυροῦσι τάρβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					290
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωπυρουμένας φρενός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1034
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς φύσεως τὸ ζωπυροῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					670a25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.940c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. τινά</span>
			<i>to provoke</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				682
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ. τρυφήν</span>
			<i>increase</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Lyc.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; in Magic, <i>quicken, fill with power,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMag.Leid.V.
				10.7
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>burst into flame</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢν ἡ θέρμη ζωπυρῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					1.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
